      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Your hospital needs blood to feed starving vampire families.


    Patients

    Drain
    blood from them or kill them to get even more blood

    Be aware of sick patients!


    Ghost

    For
    each killed patient, one ghost will hount the hospital.

    Collect them and
    exchange for useful buffs.

    Be aware, if too much ghosts will hount the hospital,

    patients
    wont be willing to visit your hospital and GAME will be OVER.

    The more ghosts
    you have, the less patients will visit.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
